# Every shipped zone's Display Time Zone Description Details on the primary
# (V7R1M0): WRKTIMZON page by page, option 5 on each row, the details'
# pages shown (`show`, not snapshots: the default masks hide times).
# Generated from the zone list (93 zones, 11 a page); read-only.
wait "Sign On"
signon
settle 3000
timeout 30000
key enter
settle 2000
type call qcmd
key enter
wait "Command Entry"
continue
type WRKTIMZON
key enter
settle 3000
